          "response_format_name": null,
          "text": "{\"prompt\":\"A realistic Ubuntu terminal window screenshot (purple background, typical GNOME Terminal style). The terminal shows the following exact content with proper monospace alignment:\\n\\n$ /bin/hdfs dfs -cat output/*\\n1\\tdfs.datanode.data.dir\\n1\\tdfs.namenode.name.dir\\n1\\tdfs.replication\\n\\nDetails:\\n- There is a space after the dollar sign prompt ($ ).\\n- The numbers '1' are followed by a TAB character before the text (visually aligned columns).\\n- The three output lines are sorted alphabetically by the text.\\n- The window includes a title bar similar to Ubuntu terminal with menu text like \\\"Terminal\\\".\\n- Cursor is not visible.\\n- Clean, sharp, high-resolution screenshot style, no extra noise or artifacts.\",\"size\":\"1024x768\",\"n\":1}"
