        "create_time": 1777549756.167,
        "update_time": null,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "使用上述风格，继续制作截图：\"\"\"\n截图1: 创建hadoop用户目录并列出根目录\n\n  $ cd /usr/local/hadoop\n  $ ./bin/hdfs dfs -mkdir -p /user/hadoop\n  $ ./bin/hdfs dfs -ls /\n  Found 1 items\n  drwxr-xr-x   - hadoop supergroup          0 2026-04-30 20:15 /user\n\n  截图2: 列出hadoop用户目录内容(初始为空)\n\n  $ ./bin/hdfs dfs -ls /user/hadoop\n  (无输出,因为目录刚创建是空的)\n\n  截图3: 创建input目录并再次列出\n\n  $ ./bin/hdfs dfs -mkdir input\n  $ ./bin/hdfs dfs -ls /user/hadoop\n  Found 1 items\n  drwxr-xr-x   - hadoop supergroup          0 2026-04-30 20:16 /user/hadoop/input\n\n  截图4: 列出input目录内容(为空)\n\n  $ ./bin/hdfs dfs -ls /user/hadoop/input\n  (无输出)\n\n  制作提示:\n  - 在Ubuntu终端中输入这些命令\n  - 时间戳用今天的日期 2026-04-30\n  - 用户名固定为 hadoop\n  - 权限固定为 drwxr-xr-x\n  - 组固定为 supergroup\"\"\""
          ]
        },
